---
// Resolution Path 01 Component
---
<section class="v6-section bg-light">
  <div class="sec-container">
    <div class="sec-header">
      <span class="sec-num">RESOLUTION PATH · 01</span>
      <h2>From concern to resolution in under a minute.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="res-grid">
      <div class="res-steps">
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-badge">01</span>
          <h3>Buy once</h3>
          <p>One-time payment of $24 via Lemon Squeezy. No subscription, no recurring charges, no cloud locker fees.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-badge">02</span>
          <h3>Install</h3>
          <p>Download the lightweight Windows app, unzip, and sign in locally. Zero administrator privileges required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-badge">03</span>
          <h3>Pick a provider</h3>
          <p>Select from ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, or Grok. Your session cookies never leave your machine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <span class="step-badge">04</span>
          <h3>Export</h3>
          <p>Instantly writes clean, structured Markdown and JSON files directly into a folder of your choice on your drive.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="res-mockup">
        <div class="mockup-window">
          <div class="mockup-bar">
            <span class="dot red"></span>
            <span class="dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="dot green"></span>
            <span class="mockup-path">C:\TotalRecalls\Library</span>
          </div>
          <div class="mockup-content">
            <div class="mockup-tree">
              <div class="tree-item active">📁 ChatGPT (284 files)</div>
              <div class="tree-item">📁 Claude (192 files)</div>
              <div class="tree-item">📁 Perplexity (145 files)</div>
              <div class="tree-item">📁 Gemini (98 files)</div>
              <div class="tree-item">📁 Grok (78 files)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="mockup-command-center">
              <strong>Local storage. Your drive. Your files.</strong>
              <span>No remote servers intercepting your intellectual property.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mockup-cta">
          <a href="/pricing/" class="buy-button" data-tr-buy>BEGIN RESOLUTION →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .v6-section {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
  .bg-light { background: #F8FAFC; }
  }
  .sec-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .sec-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }
  .sec-num {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2F7BFF;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .sec-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #0F172A;
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .res-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .res-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }
  .step-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: var(--space-5);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    position: relative;
  }
  .step-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 20px;
    background: #0F172A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .step-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0F172A;
    margin: var(--space-2) 0 var(--space-2) 0;
  }
  .step-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #475569;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .mockup-window {
    background: #0F172A;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 32px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.2);
  }
  .mockup-bar {
    background: #1E293B;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #334155;
  }
  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .red { background: #EF4444; }
  .yellow { background: #F59E0B; }
  .green { background: #10B981; }
  .mockup-path {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #94A3B8;
  }
  .mockup-content {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-5);
  }
  .mockup-tree {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }
  .tree-item {
    background: #1E293B;
    color: #CBD5E1;
    padding: 8px 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid #334155;
  }
  .tree-item.active {
    background: #1E3A8A;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #2F7BFF;
  }
  .mockup-command-center {
    background: #0B0F19;
    border: 1px dashed #334155;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .mockup-command-center strong {
    display: block;
    color: #38BDF8;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .mockup-command-center span {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #94A3B8;
  }
  .mockup-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
    text-align: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .res-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .res-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
